{
  "info": {
    "name": "Sistema Hospy - Completo JWT",
    "description": "## Flujo rápido (como tu login admin 200 OK)\n\n1. Importa también `Sistema-Hospy.postman_environment.json` y selecciónalo.\n2. **Health** → verifica backend.\n3. **① Login Admin** → guarda `token` automático.\n4. Usa carpetas 02 Admin, 04 Paciente, 05 Médico con Bearer.\n\n### JWT en Postman\n- Login devuelve: `token`, `tipo`, `id`, `nombre`, `email`, `rol`\n- Header: `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`\n\n### Crear usuarios (requiere token admin)\n| Rol | POST |\n|-----|------|\n| Paciente público | `/auth/register` sin JWT |\n| Paciente | `/admin/usuarios` rol PACIENTE |\n| Médico | `/admin/medicos` |\n| Admin | `/admin/usuarios` rol ADMIN |\n\n### Recursividad (HU-15)\n`GET /admin/reportes?anio=2026` → `desgloseMensual` generado con recursión.\n\n**Admin:** admin@hospy.com / admin123",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080/api" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "tokenMedico", "value": "" },
    { "key": "tokenPaciente", "value": "" },
    { "key": "citaId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "medicoId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "usuarioId", "value": "2" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Auth (JWT)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health" }
        },
        {
          "name": "① Login Admin → guarda token",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "const j = pm.response.json();",
                "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                "pm.test('JWT presente', () => pm.expect(j.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
                "if (j.token) {",
                "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.token);",
                "  pm.environment.set('token', j.token);",
                "  console.log('ADMIN token guardado');",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@hospy.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\",\n  \"rol\": \"ADMIN\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register Paciente (sin JWT)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Ana López\",\n  \"email\": \"ana@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\",\n  \"documento\": \"98765432\",\n  \"telefono\": \"3009998877\",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"1995-03-15\",\n  \"genero\": \"Femenino\",\n  \"tipoSangre\": \"O+\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Calle 10 #20\",\n  \"ciudad\": \"Bogotá\",\n  \"alergias\": \"Ninguna\",\n  \"contactoEmergencia\": \"Carlos López\",\n  \"telefonoEmergencia\": \"3001112233\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Paciente → guarda tokenPaciente",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "const j = pm.response.json();",
                "if (j.token) {",
                "  pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenPaciente', j.token);",
                "  pm.environment.set('tokenPaciente', j.token);",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ana@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\",\n  \"rol\": \"PACIENTE\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Médico → guarda tokenMedico",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "const j = pm.response.json();",
                "if (j.token) {",
                "  pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenMedico', j.token);",
                "  pm.environment.set('tokenMedico', j.token);",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"doctor@hospy.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Medico123\",\n  \"rol\": \"MEDICO\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Admin (Bearer {{token}})",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Administradores (CRUD)",
          "description": "Crear/editar/eliminar admins NUEVOS. No uses id=1 (admin@hospy.com del sistema). Bearer en cada request.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "1. Listar usuarios (ver ids)",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios",
                "description": "Copia `usuarioId` del admin nuevo para editar/eliminar. NO toques id 1 si es el admin principal."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "2. Crear Administrador NUEVO",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"María García\",\n  \"email\": \"maria.admin@hospy.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin123\",\n  \"rol\": \"ADMIN\",\n  \"telefono\": \"3001110001\",\n  \"cargo\": \"Coordinadora\",\n  \"departamento\": \"Sistemas\",\n  \"extensionTelefonica\": \"101\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "3. Editar Administrador",
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"María García Actualizada\",\n  \"email\": \"maria.admin@hospy.com\",\n  \"rol\": \"ADMIN\",\n  \"telefono\": \"3001110099\",\n  \"cargo\": \"Jefa de sistemas\",\n  \"departamento\": \"TI\",\n  \"activo\": true\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios/{{usuarioId}}",
                "description": "usuarioId = ID de la tabla usuarios (campo usuarioId en el listado). NO el id=1 del admin@hospy.com salvo que quieras editarlo."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "4. Eliminar (desactivar) Administrador",
              "request": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios/{{usuarioId}}",
                "description": "Desactiva el usuario (activo=false). Usa usuarioId del admin NUEVO, no el 1 del sistema."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Médicos (CRUD)",
          "description": "Crear/editar/eliminar médicos NUEVOS. PUT usa medicoId. DELETE usa usuarioId.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "1. Listar médicos (ver ids)",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/medicos",
                "description": "Copia `id` → variable medicoId (editar). Copia `usuarioId` → variable usuarioId (eliminar)."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "2. Crear Médico NUEVO",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Dr. Pedro Ruiz\",\n  \"email\": \"pedro@hospy.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Medico123\",\n  \"rol\": \"MEDICO\",\n  \"telefono\": \"3005554433\",\n  \"especialidad\": \"Pediatría\",\n  \"numeroLicencia\": \"MED-002\",\n  \"consultorio\": \"Piso 2 - 205\",\n  \"anosExperiencia\": 8,\n  \"biografia\": \"Pediatra general\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/medicos"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "3. Editar Médico",
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Dr. Pedro Ruiz Actualizado\",\n  \"email\": \"pedro@hospy.com\",\n  \"rol\": \"MEDICO\",\n  \"telefono\": \"3005559999\",\n  \"especialidad\": \"Pediatría\",\n  \"consultorio\": \"Piso 3 - 301\",\n  \"anosExperiencia\": 9,\n  \"activo\": true\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/medicos/{{medicoId}}",
                "description": "medicoId = campo `id` del listado de médicos (NO usuarioId)."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "4. Eliminar (desactivar) Médico",
              "request": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios/{{usuarioId}}",
                "description": "usuarioId = campo usuarioId del médico en el listado."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Pacientes (crear)",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Crear Paciente",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Juan Pérez\",\n  \"email\": \"juan@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\",\n  \"rol\": \"PACIENTE\",\n  \"telefono\": \"3008887766\",\n  \"documento\": \"12345678\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Citas",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Supervisar citas",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/citas"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Reportes",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Reportes resumen + mensual (RECURSIVO)",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/reportes?anio=2026",
                "description": "desgloseMensual usa agregarMesRecursivo() en el backend."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 - Público",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar médicos",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/medicos" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Horarios médico",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/medicos/{{medicoId}}/horarios" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 - Paciente (Bearer {{tokenPaciente}})",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Dashboard",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/paciente/dashboard"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mi perfil GET",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/paciente/perfil"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar perfil PUT",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Ana López\",\n  \"telefono\": \"3009998877\",\n  \"documento\": \"98765432\",\n  \"ciudad\": \"Bogotá\",\n  \"alergias\": \"Ninguna\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/paciente/perfil"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Agendar cita POST",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"medicoId\": {{medicoId}},\n  \"fechaHora\": \"2026-06-15T10:00:00\",\n  \"motivo\": \"Control general\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/paciente/citas"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Historial citas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/paciente/citas/historial"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Próximas citas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/paciente/citas/proximas"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancelar cita",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/paciente/citas/{{citaId}}/cancelar"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 - Médico (Bearer {{tokenMedico}})",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Dashboard",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenMedico}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/medico/dashboard"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mi perfil",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenMedico}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/medico/perfil"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mis citas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenMedico}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/medico/citas"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Aceptar cita",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenMedico}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/medico/citas/{{citaId}}/aceptar"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Rechazar cita",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenMedico}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/medico/citas/{{citaId}}/rechazar"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ver paciente de cita",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenMedico}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/medico/citas/{{citaId}}/paciente"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mis horarios",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenMedico}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/medico/horarios"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear horario",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenMedico}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"diaSemana\": 1,\n  \"horaInicio\": \"08:00\",\n  \"horaFin\": \"12:00\",\n  \"disponible\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/medico/horarios"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar horario",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenMedico}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/medico/horarios/1"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
